# Cloudflare Pages proxy — keeps API and storage requests same-origin with the
# static app. 200 = proxy/rewrite, the client URL never changes. Order matters:
# Pages applies the first matching rule. No secret values belong in this file.
# The Worker also serves these paths directly (verified live /healthz 200).

/functions/v1/app/* https://studybridge-ai-final.zainabshoaib496.workers.dev/functions/v1/app/:splat 200
/storage/* https://studybridge-ai-final.zainabshoaib496.workers.dev/storage/:splat 200
